# PHASE 3 — CHUNKING ENGINE

Implement a deterministic chunking engine.

Requirements:

* configurable maximum chunk size
* configurable overlap
* deterministic chunk IDs
* stable ordering
* source-document reference
* chunk index
* chunk text
* metadata inheritance
* content checksum
* version reference

Chunking must preserve the relationship:

Document → Version → Chunk

